rive.google.com/drive/folders/1Zovag9J6SWh0jPvzh-SwAMHRSSJlVgUV?usp=sharing", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@rojobread/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1262433, "client_id": 1031168, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/7899f687/uploads/origins/141fc1ac-e2ac-40c5-a0c9-bdad31e460ef?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ad99becd58e2850f8226c3680e870cbf", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7899f687/uploads/origins/141fc1ac-e2ac-40c5-a0c9-bdad31e460ef?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ad99becd58e2850f8226c3680e870cbf, https://si.imgix.net/7899f687/uploads/origins/141fc1ac-e2ac-40c5-a0c9-bdad31e460ef?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3359a9eadb18a98c3851a311c3db7370 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7899f687/uploads/origins/141fc1ac-e2ac-40c5-a0c9-bdad31e460ef?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e2fbb46025e43672fa3188a1df3aed0f 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/7899f687/uploads/origins/141fc1ac-e2ac-40c5-a0c9-bdad31e460ef?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4b31bf1f72a3c740de91a55c013de5d6", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7899f687/uploads/origins/141fc1ac-e2ac-40c5-a0c9-bdad31e460ef?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4b31bf1f72a3c740de91a55c013de5d6, https://si.imgix.net/7899f687/uploads/origins/141fc1ac-e2ac-40c5-a0c9-bdad31e460ef?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e9a85cc51336a191f8d71f85cf35cb7b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7899f687/uploads/origins/141fc1ac-e2ac-40c5-a0c9-bdad31e460ef?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=00f28f8905161c73e0b5c115fe861ae2 3x"}, "body": "Nice to meet you, I like your art so much that I would like to submit a personal request to you for my oc.\n彼らの獸人パロをご利用ください。（https://sta.sh/22da6glgmb6w）\n構図: 彼らは事務所の応接間で国際碁を打っていた。ルービックキューブとか、新聞の数独とか、その他の小物が横に置かれていた。盤面の形勢はご自由にどうぞ。\n**事務所は彼らの家でもあり、生活の匂いがあるはずだ。* *\n\n\nPlease refer to the original setting for personality. Other details are up to you. If you have a better idea of how to interpret the scene, you can also modify the composition. I would be very happy to draw it the way you like!\nThanks for your time. If there is no burden to your schedule and body, I hope you can consider it. If you don't like the commission, you can cancel it directly. It doesn't matter!\nAnd it is best to close the signature in the PSD file! Have a nice day!\n\nLink: https://sta.sh/22fkv8jzuavs", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@rojobread/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1262433, "client_id": 2363618, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/6633ea76/uploads/origins/8fbafabf-7ab9-4d1b-bfe8-2dc94040faed?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c0a3c577cea4f4f201e3d5c922d607fb", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6633ea76/uploads/origins/8fbafabf-7ab9-4d1b-bfe8-2dc94040faed?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c0a3c577cea4f4f201e3d5c922d607fb, https://si.imgix.net/6633ea76/uploads/origins/8fbafabf-7ab9-4d1b-bfe8-2dc94040faed?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=396775fcd02620cf7d8a28a458e02f5c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6633ea76/uploads/origins/8fbafabf-7ab9-4d1b-bfe8-2dc94040faed?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=759d35419d2adf7366a98f3226b3b23d 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/6633ea76/uploads/origins/8fbafabf-7ab9-4d1b-bfe8-2dc94040faed?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2db4267c231cb0efce4b760256e1a5dd", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6633ea76/uploads/origins/8fbafabf-7ab9-4d1b-bfe8-2dc94040faed?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2db4267c231cb0efce4b760256e1a5dd, https://si.imgix.net/6633ea76/uploads/origins/8fbafabf-7ab9-4d1b-bfe8-2dc94040faed?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=37057e920391d22c655579b5b36a9b7b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6633ea76/uploads/origins/8fbafabf-7ab9-4d1b-bfe8-2dc94040faed?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0fb3f4cdf28c0e465d89b43396af55b9 3x"}, "body": "初めまして。\nスケブで生き生きとしたイラストレーションを拝見して、ぜひ自作小説のオリジナルキャラクターを描いていただきたく、リクエストいたします。\n描いていただきたいキャラクターはメインの3人です。\n\nキャラデザはこちら\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/10V8XMnPidHcu8EmoNWDbtgYDBJuoQ3Aa/view?usp=drivesdk\n\n足もとはこちらをご参照ください\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1uECYs6B4TmdIAVhONoDieaKPKdXzCzsM/view?usp=drivesdk\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1JnUbcXkAeQm1nXZ3n8uGNeoHUdzm6N9e/view?usp=drivesdk\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1TSLzDRMilHUHyXDZ9yWxDiyILC0JY7H9/view?usp=drivesdk\n\nニーナ：女/15歳/白髪/白い肌/金色の目/小柄/表情に乏しい/ワンピースの襟元に桜の刺繍がある\n\n十六夜：男/19歳/黒髪/右目が灰白色/左目が黒色/上は着物、下は革のパンツとブーツ。和洋折衷の出立ち\n\nパコ：男/17歳/金髪/紫の目/左目の下に泣きぼくろ/中性的な顔立ち/ハンチング帽を被っている\n\n描いていただきたいのは三人が港町にいるところです。世界観は19世紀ヨーロッパ風（市場が栄え、蒸気船や蒸気機関車が走っているイメージ）。シチュエーションはお任せいたします。三人はカメラ目線ではないほうが良いです（ニーナだけは笑いません）。\n\n小説の宣伝用に使わせていただきたいので、サインのレイヤーは分けていただきたく存じます。\n何卒よろしくお願い致します。\n\nhttps://ncode.syosetu.com/n4464ht/", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@rojobread/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1262433, "client_id": 1361630, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/88bd0875/uploads/origins/55001ba2-0af1-4468-bdc0-6b26fac92bba?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fb082a783976a2121b700d3d8e82e732", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/88bd0875/uploads/origins/55001ba2-0af1-4468-bdc0-6b26fac92bba?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fb082a783976a2121b700d3d8e82e732, https://si.imgix.net/88bd0875/uploads/origins/55001ba2-0af1-4468-bdc0-6b26fac92bba?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=401097f238800b4d79daad43bf9f1f12 2x, https://si.imgix.net/88bd0875/uploads/origins/55001ba2-0af1-4468-bdc0-6b26fac92bba?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=534dd2ca85d9c797ab1694359f7ea51c 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/88bd0875/uploads/origins/55001ba2-0af1-4468-bdc0-6b26fac92bba?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5e9d71a83c90446c17fa760aa1ed205d", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/88bd0875/uploads/origins/55001ba2-0af1-4468-bdc0-6b26fac92bba?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5e9d71a83c90446c17fa760aa1ed205d, https://si.imgix.net/88bd0875/uploads/origins/55001ba2-0af1-4468-bdc0-6b26fac92bba?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4b9c64bf125f0ef30ec537d19faebff8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/88bd0875/uploads/origins/55001ba2-0af1-4468-bdc0-6b26fac92bba?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3aa97a3cf2ba17237cc9853786915692 3x"}, "body": "うまいだけでなく、振り幅がエグい路上さんの絵がとても好きです！\nよければうちの鬼っ子をリクエストさせてください🙇‍♂️\nキャラについて決まっているのはリンク先のことくらいなので、あとはフリーダムに路上さんの世界観で描いていただけるとうれしいです！\n\nhttps://twitter.com/shizimiz/status/15791044571741593